    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Quelle émission pourriez-vous regarder en frénésie pendant le temps qu’il vous reste Before de mourir ? ",
      "n": "QuestionText2"
    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Before",
      "n": "BumperPlacement"
    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Say you accidentally watched the cursed VHS tape from <i>The Ring</i>.",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Tu peux avoir la télécommande quand je serai mort ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "731186_1",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Nous parlons de 895 épisodes ! Vous ne verriez même pas la moitié de sa collection de cardigans. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "731198_3",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "On dit que nous vivons dans un âge d’or de la télévision, et il n’y a pas de meilleur moment pour l’apprécier que lorsqu’une démone aux cheveux filandreux va en sortir et vous étrangler. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "731187_1",
      "n": "IntroAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "731189_2",
      "n": "ChoicesAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Non, tu es mort, et c'est probablement la faute de Wesley. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "731196_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio2"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "The curse in the Ring gives you one week to live, which is enough time to watch all 236 half-hour episodes of Friends.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "731191_2",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "And who knows: Janice’s laugh could frighten off Samara before she gets to you.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "731192_1",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Say you accidentally watched the cursed VHS tape from <i>The Ring</i>. Which show could you binge-watch in the time you have left before you die?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "731188_3",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
  ]
